  "description": "Take family bike rides to the next level with Rover Plus. This premium bike trailer for kids can carry 1-2 passengers and lets little ones tag along safely and comfortably whenever you want to head out for a ride. Compatible with most adult bikes and ebikes, this bicycle trailer’s folding frame is made from lightweight aluminum that makes it easy to tow, store, and carry. Safety features like a 5-point harness with an easy-to-use buckle and high visibility fabric, reflectors, and flag keep kids safe inside the trailer and out. An extra-roomy interior with pockets for snacks and toys, padded straps, and smooth-rolling spoked wheels keep them comfortable on every ride. Plus, with enough storage space to bring along everything you need, Rover Plus turns every ride into a new adventure together.",
